  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1221/93/frame-58.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"808\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">✨ 主要功能：</span></h2>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">📱 自定义手机物品：获取并使用独特的手机物品，体验其流畅的界面。</span></strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">🥽 个人PIN码系统：每位玩家均可设置专属PIN码作为手机的通讯标识符。</span></strong></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">🧩 联系人管理：使用其他玩家的专属PIN码轻松将其添加至通讯录。</span></strong></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">📨 即时通讯：与联系人实时收发文字消息。</span></strong></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">📃 聊天记录：所有聊天内容均会保存，随时可回顾过往对话。</span></strong></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">🔭 服务器适配：专为角色扮演（RP）服务器打造，也适合任何希望提升玩家间沉浸式内部交流的社区。</span></strong></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>🚀 使用方法：</strong></span></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h4><strong>📱&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">获取手机：合成“手机”物品。</span></strong></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">🔧 进行设置：手持手机并打开界面。首次使用时，请设置密码并获取专属PIN码。</span></strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">📋 添加联系人：进入“通讯录”应用，通过PIN码添加好友。</span></strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">💬 开始聊天！进入“消息”应用，选择联系人即可开始对话。</span></strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>🙋 支持与反馈：</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/RZz3pJKtmH\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>🎫 发现漏洞？有新想法？请在 Discord 中告诉我们！</strong></a></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\"><strong>🤝 鸣谢：</strong></span></h2>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>&nbsp;本模组灵感源自法国YouTuber“Mastu”创建的半角色扮演服务器“CrazyTown”。</span></strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>-----------------------------------------------</strong></span></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用 Meulti 的简易手机模组，提升服务器的交流与沉浸体验！</strong></strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">-----------------------------------------------</strong></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<br>📢 立即加入我们！</span></strong></h2>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br><span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/RZz3pJKtmH\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord：https://discord.gg/RZz3pJKtmH</a></span><br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</span></strong></h4>",
